      "v": 11,
      "zh": "这样，你们向罪也当看自己是死的；向　神在基督耶稣里，却当看自己是活的。",
      "en": "So you too consider yourselves[NOTE:1] dead to sin, but[NOTE:2] alive to God in Christ Jesus.",
